    "extract": "Panola College is a public community college in Carthage, Texas, the county seat of Panola County. As defined by the Texas Legislature, the official service area of Panola College includes:all of Marion, Panola, and Shelby Counties, and\nall of Harrison County excluding the territory within the Hallsville Independent School District.",
    "extract_html": "<p><b>Panola College</b> is a public community college in Carthage, Texas, the county seat of Panola County. As defined by the Texas Legislature, the official service area of Panola College includes:</p><ul><li>all of Marion, Panola, and Shelby Counties, and</li>\n<li>all of Harrison County excluding the territory within the Hallsville Independent School District.</li></ul>"
